{"id":"n66569-2-7","stage":2,"title":"알아듣다 · 听出来","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66569-2-7-1","ko":"너 왜 또 늦었어?","zh":"你怎么又迟到了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"늦었어?","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦었어","audio":"/audio/f69554c7be7671b373df.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b643dff6d310443a06b6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66569-2-7-2","ko":"지하철에서 졸다가 역 이름을 잘못 알아듣고 다른 역에서 내렸지 뭐야.","zh":"我在地铁上打瞌睡，听错了站名，结果竟然在别的站下了车。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지하철에서","meaning":"地铁","explanation":"지하철：地铁；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"지하철","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71490","senseId":"1","lemma":"지하철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지하철에서","audio":"/audio/c3526360e15520ecc415.mp3"}},{"text":"졸다가","meaning":"打盹儿，打瞌睡","explanation":"졸다：打盹儿，打瞌睡；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"졸다","audio":"/audio/53086bb09e89af70dd9d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63501","senseId":"1","lemma":"졸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"졸다가","audio":"/audio/7a359df93b299bf54759.mp3"}},{"text":"역","meaning":"车站（本句指地铁站）","explanation":"역 是列车到达或出发的车站；本句是在地铁里听错站名，不是古代传递文书的驿站。","readings":[{"term":"역","audio":"/audio/0d8513f4ca123f336cd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70724","senseId":"1","lemma":"역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"역","audio":"/audio/0d8513f4ca123f336cd9.mp3"}},{"text":"이름을","meaning":"名字，名称","explanation":"이름：名字，名称；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71692","senseId":"1","lemma":"이름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이름을","audio":"/audio/c2024c1d7bd90d3cff86.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못","meaning":"错","explanation":"잘못：错","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62478","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}},{"text":"알아듣고","meaning":"听出来","explanation":"알아듣다：听出来；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"알아듣다","audio":"/audio/dd1a5d23abf4863ecde0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66569","senseId":"2","lemma":"알아듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아듣고","audio":"/audio/94f1e75821677502dcf0.mp3"}},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"역에서","meaning":"车站（本句指地铁站）","explanation":"역 是列车到达或出发的车站；本句是在地铁里听错站名，不是古代传递文书的驿站。","readings":[{"term":"역","audio":"/audio/0d8513f4ca123f336cd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70724","senseId":"1","lemma":"역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"역에서","audio":"/audio/063a232a8f106008c11d.mp3"}},{"text":"내렸지","meaning":"下了车","explanation":"내리다：从交通工具上下来；-었지 和后面的 뭐야 合用，回想意外或不如意的结果，不是这里发生否定或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"내리다","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73353","senseId":"4","lemma":"내리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내렸지","audio":"/audio/db6ae9763f947eeac08b.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야.","meaning":"结果竟然……了（感叹意外结果）","explanation":"-었지 뭐야 是对已经发生的意外结果的感叹；本句叙述自己听错站名而下错车，不是询问别人或猜测是否下车。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfb8c73b9f048c3b","term":"지하철","zh":"地铁","audio":"/audio/dfb8c73b9f048c3b7e27.mp3","entryId":"71490","definition":"行驶在地下铁路的电动车。","pronunciation":["지하철"]},{"id":"53086bb09e89af70","term":"졸다","zh":"打盹儿，打瞌睡","audio":"/audio/53086bb09e89af70dd9d.mp3","entryId":"63501","definition":"没完全睡着，但总处于想入睡的状态。","pronunciation":["졸ː다"]},{"id":"0d8513f4ca123f33","term":"역","zh":"车站","audio":"/audio/0d8513f4ca123f336cd9.mp3","entryId":"70724","definition":"车站","pronunciation":["역"]},{"id":"253d1510caf53620","term":"이름","zh":"名字，名称","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3","entryId":"71692","definition":"为了区别于他物，给动物、事物、现象等而赋予的称号。","pronunciation":["이름"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62478","definition":"不正或错误地。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]},{"id":"dd1a5d23abf4863e","term":"알아듣다","zh":"听出来","audio":"/audio/dd1a5d23abf4863ecde0.mp3","entryId":"66569","definition":"听某个声音，并知道是什么声音或是谁的声音。","pronunciation":["아라듣따"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"01d776172b3f93c3","term":"내리다","zh":"下车","audio":"/audio/01d776172b3f93c3c9d5.mp3","entryId":"73353","definition":"下车","pronunciation":["내리다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么、怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"什么、怎么回事","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/57376290483ef44f460c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.692,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66569","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4173,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["在地铁上打瞌睡，没听清站名，结果在别的站下了吧。","我的牙齿松动了，所以来医院了。","你怎么又迟到了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我在地铁上打瞌睡，听错了站名，结果竟然在别的站下了车。","你怎么又迟到了？","我的牙齿松动了，所以来医院了。"],"answer":0}]}
